   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Rental conditions",
     "texto": [
      "**Leiekontrakt** is rental contract; **Oppsigelsestid**, the notice period for ending the contract; **innflytting** is the moving-in date. Read the terms before signing."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Subordinate clauses",
     "texto": [
      "After **at**, **hvis** and **selv om**, the usual order is subject + **ikke** + verb: **at strøm ikke er inkludert**. A relative clause with **som** describes the preceding noun."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
